### Kayıt ol
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ege Yılmaz",
  "email": "ege@test.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

###

### Giriş yap (Öğrenci)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ege@test.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

###

### Giriş yap (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@platform.com",
  "password": "Admin1234!"
}

###

### Tüm kursları listele
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses

###

### Kategori ve zorluğa göre filtrele (difficulty: 0=Beginner, 1=Intermediate, 2=Advanced)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses?category=programlama&difficulty=0

###

### Kurs oluştur (Admin token gerekli)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "title": "C# ile Nesne Yönelimli Programlama",
  "description": "C# dilinde OOP kavramlarını öğrenin.",
  "category": "Programlama",
  "difficulty": 0,
  "ectsCredit": 5
}

###

### Kurs düzenle (Admin token gerekli)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "title": "C# ile OOP - Güncel",
  "description": "Güncellenmiş açıklama.",
  "category": "Programlama",
  "difficulty": 1,
  "ectsCredit": 6
}

###

### Kurs sil (Admin token gerekli)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
